# Database & API Structure

## Database
- MongoDB with Prisma ORM
- Schema defined in [prisma](mdc:prisma) directory
- Main collections: Users, Presentations, Slides, Assets

## API Structure
- REST endpoints in [src/app/api](mdc:src/app/api)
- Authentication handled by NextAuth.js
- API routes follow RESTful conventions

## Data Models
- Presentations: Contains metadata and references to slides
- Slides: Individual slides with layouts and elements
- Elements: Components within slides (text, images, etc.)
- Assets: Uploaded or generated files (images, PDFs)

## API Operations
- CRUD operations for presentations
- User authentication and management
- Asset uploads and management
- Export functionality